---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import PortfolioImage from '../components/PortfolioImage.astro';
import SocialLinks from '../components/SocialLinks.astro';
import '../styles/about-layout.css';
---
<Site title="About — Lehel Babos" about>
  <section class="page-section about-section" aria-labelledby="about-name">
    <div class="section-content portfolio-grid about-profile-grid">
      <div class="grid-block about-portrait"><div class="block">
        <PortfolioImage name="profile.jpeg" class="profile-portrait" alt="Lehel working on his laptop at a café" priority sizes="(max-width: 767px) 88vw, 32vw" />
      </div></div>
      <div class="grid-block about-name"><div class="block"><h1 id="about-name" class="profile-name">Lehel Babos</h1></div></div>
      <div class="grid-block about-location"><div class="block"><p class="sqsrte-small"><strong>Location</strong><br />Toronto, Canada</p></div></div>
      <div class="grid-block about-employer"><div class="block"><p class="sqsrte-small"><strong>Working at</strong><br />SimpleHedge</p></div></div>
      <div class="grid-block about-bio"><div class="block"><p><em>Part time coffee nerd, occasional cyclist. Obsessive about typography. Currently dormant globe trotter.</em></p></div></div>
      <div class="grid-block about-social"><div class="block"><SocialLinks variant="profile" /></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="page-section about-section" aria-labelledby="design-thoughts">
    <div class="section-content portfolio-grid about-story-grid">
      <div class="grid-block about-story"><div class="block"><div class="about-story-content">
        <h2 id="design-thoughts">Some thoughts on design</h2>
        <p>I believe good design doesn't happen in a vacuum. Building and delivering products is a team sport, and one of the most challenging but rewarding aspects of my work is being a conduit between design, engineering and business strategy. Helping other designers improve their craft, and making design accessible to those who are new to it.</p>
        <p>I focus on breaking down and simplifying complex user problems, to build clean, effective and accessible solutions. I think a lot about personal and team process, how to build and maintain a healthy team culture, and scale design across companies of different sizes. <a href="https://medium.com/@lehel/latest"><strong>Sometimes I write about it on Medium.</strong></a></p>
        <h2>Other pursuits</h2>
        <p>When I'm not pushing code, pixels or sticky notes, I'm usually cycling, taking photos, eating and drinking my way across whatever city I happen to be in, one cocktail bar and noodle shop at a time.<a href="https://www.instagram.com/whereislehel"><strong>Curious? Check out my instagram.</strong></a></p>
      </div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
